    "comment" : "\n     * Sets this SocketFlow's priority. Must be either NORMAL_PRIORITY\n     * HIGH_PRIORITY. If not set, a flow's priority is normal.\n     *\n     * @throws IllegalArgumentException if priority is not NORMAL_PRIORITY or\n     *         HIGH_PRIORITY.\n     ",
